# Clean-room

This is an original dual-stick skate sim (**Noisses**). Do not reverse-engineer, decompile, or copy assets, code, models, sounds, or exact numbers from *Session: Skate Sim*.

- Original geometry, textures, animation, and sound only.
- Never load files from any commercial skate game.
- Do not use official Session names, logos, or character likenesses.
- Physics constants are invented here. Write them in `js/constants.js` with comments. Unknown value → pick heavy/realistic and document it.
- Trick detection comes from the behavioral spec in `bootstrap.md`, not recorded game data.
